00:30:58,880 --> 00:31:01,520
 You go back and read Jeremiah 7.

387
00:31:01,520 --> 00:31:04,000
 It's called the temple address.

388
00:31:04,000 --> 00:31:06,560
 It's a stinging indictment of false worship.

