00:31:16,160 --> 00:31:18,000
 You're committing all kinds of injustice.

392
00:31:18,000 --> 00:31:20,720
 You're ignoring injustice.

393
00:31:20,720 --> 00:31:26,080
 You're pretending like you're worshiping, but you're ignoring me."

