00:31:37,760 --> 00:31:40,000
 Oh, what a picture.

398
00:31:40,000 --> 00:31:48,320
 Stubbornness, like hardness of heart that presumed to be worshiping while ignoring sin.

399
00:31:48,320 --> 00:31:51,120
 Is that possible among us?

400
00:31:51,120 --> 00:31:58,480
 Is it possible to sing songs, listen to prayers, sermon, do religious activity,

