00:32:02,720 --> 00:32:07,600
 Let's be honest.

403
00:32:07,600 --> 00:32:08,320
 Let's get real.

404
00:32:08,320 --> 00:32:12,240
 We do it all the time.

405
00:32:12,240 --> 00:32:15,200
 We come into church gatherings, myself included.

406
00:32:15,200 --> 00:32:18,480
 We don't stop and confess sin.

