00:33:53,840 --> 00:33:59,280
 To go through the motions.

431
00:33:59,280 --> 00:34:01,600
 It's not just pornography.

432
00:34:01,600 --> 00:34:03,760
 Sexual immorality of all sorts.

433
00:34:03,760 --> 00:34:10,720
 Any and all sexual thinking, desiring, acting outside of marriage between a man and a woman.

434
00:34:10,720 --> 00:34:13,520
 God says, "Flee it."

435
00:34:13,520 --> 00:34:21,120
 And we flirt with it and indulge in it.

