00:34:21,120 --> 00:34:30,240
 On top of all sorts of idolatry of work,

437
00:34:31,840 --> 00:34:35,760
 idolatry of achievement, idolatry of appearance,

438
00:34:35,760 --> 00:34:44,640
 idolatry of body image, idolatry of approval, of control, of comfort,

439
00:34:44,640 --> 00:34:50,080
 entertainment, idolatry of money, possessions.

